  "anchor_rationale": "Q and P span the QWERTY row (max x-extent at y=1.5). Z and M span the ZXCV row (max x-extent at y=3.5). Space gives the vertical extent. Enter pins the right side. Six anchors overconstrain the 8-DoF homography 12-DoF (=image_quad to canonical_quad) -- one can fail without breaking the solve."
